; ============================================================
; TITLE:    Bubble Spiral
; CATEGORY: Spirals & Curves
; LEVEL:    Beginner
; TAGS:     spiral, arc, circles, color
; SUMMARY:  Blows a string of bubbles that grow bigger as they curl outward along a spiral path.
; ============================================================
;
; WHAT IT DOES
;   The turtle walks a spiral path without drawing it. At every stop
;   it blows a bubble: a circle drawn with ARC. The steps get longer
;   and the bubbles get bigger as it goes, so the bubbles stay just
;   touching all the way out.
;
; HOW TO USE
;   Press Run. Change the turn (28) in BUBBLES to make the spiral
;   tighter or looser.
;
; CONCEPTS YOU WILL LEARN
;   * ARC 360 radius draws a whole circle round the turtle
;   * the turtle can walk with the pen up and only draw at the stops
;   * making two things grow together (step length and bubble size)
;
; THINGS TO TRY
;   * Fill each bubble with a big DOT instead of a circle.
;   * Turn left instead of right.
;   * Make the bubbles shrink as they go out.
; ============================================================

make "colors [[80 170 230] [120 210 240] [170 140 230] [240 140 200] [120 220 190]]

to bubbles :count :turn
  localmake "step 4
  repeat :count [
    ; a bubble about as wide as the step, so neighbors just touch
    setpencolor item 1 + remainder repcount 5 :colors
    pendown arc 360 :step * 0.5
    penup forward :step right :turn
    make "step :step * 1.045
  ]
end

clearscreen hideturtle
setbackground [20 30 60]
setpensize 3
penup
bubbles 78 28
